{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-08T01:16:13.804Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"5d97cc75851de74b9275ff63","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-rrwh2o"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Combining an annotation or linked-artifact mutation with a universal output control is refused untyped: code command_failed and pm --help examples instead of a stable code and a retry without the control"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Found 2026-11-08 while verifying PR 1685 review findings. validateReadOutputOptions (src/sdk/read-output-contracts.ts) refuses a comments, notes, learnings, files, docs or package-catalog mutation combined with a universal output control (--output-budget, --output-cursor, --output-limit, --output-include, --output-session) with the message \"Universal output controls cannot be combined with a <command> mutation.\" The refusal carries no typed code. pm learnings <id> --add x --output-cursor bad --json reports code command_failed, required \"Adjust command input or tracker state and retry.\" and examples \"pm --help\" and \"pm <command> --help\". So an agent cannot key its recovery on the refusal, and the guidance never says what to do: run the mutation without the output control, or read with the output control after the write. Measured on the PR 1685 head with the built CLI in a sandbox tracker. Expected: a stable code (for example read_output_mutation_conflict), the offending output flags, and a suggested retry without them, through CLI, SDK and MCP. The refusal-closure census should count the new code. Duplicate check: searched universal output controls mutation refusal code. pm-479ggz (closed) rejected the controls for package manage diagnostics, and pm-f05lsg (open) measures recovery closure in general. Neither types this refusal."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","read-output","recovery","refusals"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-08T01:16:13.804Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-08T01:16:13.804Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":60},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The mutation and output-control refusal carries a stable typed code that the error catalog and refusal-closure census include; The refusal names the offending output flags and suggests a retry of the mutation without them through CLI, SDK and MCP"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-mpbb"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"In a sandbox tracker run pm learnings <id> --add x --output-cursor bad --json and read the code, required and examples fields"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"The refusal carries a stable code, names the offending output flags and suggests the mutation retry without them"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"code command_failed, generic required text and pm --help examples"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-479ggz","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-08T01:16:13.804Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-8s53lj"